<concept id="t00163">
	<title id="e00845">Service required </title>
	<conbody>
		<p>If you do not have your vehicle serviced according to the default service interval, the “Service required” message displays for several seconds each time you turn the <term translate="no">ENGINE START/STOP</term> button to the <term translate="no">ON</term> position.</p>
		<note type="tip" id="e00846">
			<p>Mileage and days may be incorrect in the following situations:</p>
			<ul id="e00847">
				<li id="e00848">
					<p>The battery cable is disconnected.</p>
				</li>
				<li id="e00849">
					<p>The battery is discharged.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00161.dita#t00161" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Service mode </linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>